note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note Contract section 4 line 90 and erratum E7: a continue whose innermost loop is a ROLLED loop nested in an
note unrolled body is allowed. Each of the 4 copies adds 1 for j = 0 and j = 2: exit 8.
note Twins unroll-continue-nested-rolled.om / -om1.om, same expectation (oracle/s3s4/exp).
om2
fn main to int
s = ulong 0
for i ulong 4 unroll
for j ulong 3
if eq j 1
continue
end
s = add s 1
end
end
ret int s
end
